+5成长值。部分特殊日期，会叠加珑珠奖励（礼盒样式），叠加后珑珠奖励的额度将在特殊日期上显示。\\n【连续签到】连签3天，额外奖励10成长值；连签5天，额外奖励25成长值；连签7天，额外奖励3珑珠；7天一个周期，连签奖励日期角标会有【连签】提示\\n若连签超过7天或中途断签，则连签日期将重新开始计算。断签后无法补签。若中途连签策略调整，已参与原连签策略的用户将继续原策略运行。断签或原策略完成后，才能参与新的连签策略\\n若签到当天，同时满足连续签到条件，则所有奖励会累加发放。\\n2.奖励类型\\n签到可获得【成长值】奖励或【珑珠】奖励。【成长值】可助力会员等级提升，【珑珠】可在龙湖生态内消费抵扣。奖励明细可在【我的】页面中，在珑珠明细和成长值明细中分别查看。\\n【珑珠】和【成长值】奖励分开发放，两种奖励到账时间可能存在延迟，一般会在签到成功后24小时内到账。\\n3.奖励有效期\\n【珑珠有效期】：2023年7月12日0时起，新获得的珑珠积分有效期将截至珑珠发放之日起计算的第3年12月31日24时有效。2023年7月12日0时前发放的珑珠不受影响。\\n【成长值有效期】：2023年7月12日0时起，新获得的成长值有效期将截至成长值发放之日起计算的第3年的12月31日24时有效。此规则同样适用于已累计的成长值。\\n4.签到路径\\n龙湖会员可登录龙湖APP-会员，进入本签到页面参与签到活动。\\n5.参与限制\\n同一用户（包括同一手机号、同一龙湖账号、同一终端设备等与用户身份相关的信息）每日只能在龙湖APP参与一次签到活动。对于以不正当方式参与活动的用户，或者活动方有合理理由怀疑用户存在不正当行为时，活动方有权限制异常用户参与签到的资格，并扣除已发放的奖励。\\n6.如在活动参与过程中有任何疑问，可通过“会员-客服”进行线上咨询。\\n7.在法律允许的范围内，龙湖有权对以上规则进行解释，且有权变更活动规则。\",\"sign_again_num\":3,\"task_name\":\"APP签到  奖励翻倍\",\"task_show_status\":20,\"day_received_rewards\":[],\"seven_days_signs\":[{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":11,\"sign_day\":26,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10}]},{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":11,\"sign_day\":27,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10}]},{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":11,\"sign_day\":28,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10},{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":10.0000,\"sign_type\":20}]},{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":11,\"sign_day\":29,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10}]},{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":11,\"sign_day\":30,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10},{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":25.0000,\"sign_type\":20}]},{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":12,\"sign_day\":1,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10}]},{\"sign_year\":2026,\"sign_month\":12,\"sign_day\":2,\"sign_status\":10,\"sign_rewards\":[{\"reward_type\":20,\"reward_num\":5.0000,\"sign_type\":10},{\"reward_type\":10,\"reward_num\":3.0000,\"sign_type\":20}]}],\"current_date_time\":\"1795705832048\"}}","size":3592,"mimeType":"application\/json"},"headersSize":473,"cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"Date","value":"Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:10:32 GMT"},{"name":"Content-Type","value":"application\/json;charset=UTF-8"},{"name":"Transfer-Encoding","value":"chunked"},{"name":"Connection","value":"keep-alive"},{"name":"X-Gravitee-Client-Identifier","value":"c3288c0e-c471-46e7-a88c-0ec47126e73d"},{"name":"X-Gaia-Transaction-Id","value":"d7c758dd-2fae-4315-8758-dd2fae8315db"},{"name":"X-Gaia-Request-Id","value":"d7c758dd-2fae-4315-8758-dd2fae8315db"},{"name":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials","value":"true"},{"name":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","value":"https:\/\/longzhu.longfor.com"},{"name":"Content-Encoding","value":"gzip"},{"name":"Server","value":"elb"}],"httpVersion":"HTTP\/1.1","redirectURL":""},"comment":"23:10:31.143412 [Connection] Handled by VIF\n23:10:31.143890 [TLS] TLS Client Hello SNI: gw2c-hw-open.longfor.com\n23:10:31.143938 [MITM] Enable MITM due to capture MITM override setting entry: *\n23:10:31.149887 [MITM] MITM via HTTP\/2 mode\n23:10:31.705827 [Rule] Rule evaluating requires DNS lookup for rule: RULE-SET LAN\n23:10:31.705974 [DNS] Use cached DNS result for gw2c-hw-open.longfor.com. A record count: 1, AAAA record count: 0\n23:10:31.706035 [Rule] DNS completed, IPv4 address for matching: 8.146.203.244, IPv6 address for matching: N\/A\n23:10:31.706104 [Rule] Sub-rule matched: IP-CIDR(in ChinaIPs_rules_34a9221fa066bb18.list)\n23:10:31.706125 [Rule] Rule matched: RULE-SET ChinaIPs_rules_34a9221fa066bb18.list\n23:10:31.706779 [Socket] Use the last successful address: 8.146.203.244\n23:10:31.707303 [Socket] Connecting with address: 8.146.203.244\n23:10:31.735577 [Socket] Connected to address 8.146.203.244 in 28.2ms\n23:10:31.